MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1539 (Viktor 18.10.2026: «Кнопка MIX запускает сведение, но нужна и кнопка STOP»): Stop beside Mix while a mix runs on Forge (POST /lab/daw/mix/stop), nothing made, said; the watch ends when the mix is gone from Forge.
1540 («Made from This Take висит в хвосте каждой вкладки и докучает»): the tree an entry of its own at the end of the sticky column of steps, its mark the count of branches and a light while something is made; opened where a step stands, lighting the branches of the step one came from.
1541 («кнопки с двумя словами переносятся»): .btn white-space nowrap.
1542: a silenced stretch's fall and rise its own: top-corner handles (a double-click gives back 10 ms), sides move it; scheduled as the render's raised cosines, picked up mid-fade; drawn as it sounds.
1543: groups as VCAs: «+ VCA», a VCA strip, its devices (name, members, Delete); its fader adds to its members', M mutes, S solos.
1544: the master's EQ, compressor and limiter before its fader; the kernel's Limiter is Plenio's limit streamed (5e-13), the master node within a float32 step of the render; in the path only while its compressor or limiter is on.
1545 (found by the checks): on a change of take or set the DAW kept the mix in hand under the new take's key before reading its own, so the last take's mix became the next one's, here and on Forge; the mix in hand now knows whose it is (S.owner) and is kept only under that key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
